+      "content": "You know *cuando*, *en cuanto* and *hasta que* from A2 Unit 27. For a habit or a past fact they take the indicative (*cuando llegó*, *cuando termina*). For something that has not happened yet they take the present subjunctive (*cuando termine*). The history of migration has both: the arrivals of the past and the plans of today."
